ass/fail for each criterion above.\n81\t\n82\t## HLR Traceability\n83\t\n84\t- Strategy acceptance criterion: Gen AI Studio playground RAG workflows function with\n85\t  the default vector store with no loss of current capability.\n86\t- Strategy acceptance criterion: a default vector store is available out-of-the-box\n87\t  without manual provisioning or configuration.\n88\t- Strategy acceptance criterion: the default vector store is scoped appropriately for\n89\t  multi-tenant environments.\n90\t- Strategy acceptance criterion: the default vector store is lightweight enough for\n91\t  resource-constrained environments.\n92\t- Strategy success criterion: users experience no functional regression when inline\n93\t  providers are removed from the OGX distribution.\n94\t- Staff Engineer Input: validate pgvector only for Gen AI Studio Playground RAG\n95\t  workflows (Auto Rag compatibility is out of scope, deferred to RHAISTRAT-7824);\n96\t  benchmark criterion is order-of-magnitude, not a threshold; BFF lifecycle behaviors\n97\t  (cleanup, restarts) need verification.\n98\t\n99\t## Risks / Notes\n100\t\n101\t- Requires the pgvector provider wiring, the BFF-managed provisioning, and the inline\n102\t  Milvus baseline to be in place before the comparison scenarios can run.\n103\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-97085c80c2e4a002","agent_id":"aa401dc28139df828","session_id":"dea9077a-5606-465d-8634-40ab1d74f5b7","uuid":"b08f57f2-3323-4b7d-8232-f44832a06f75","timestamp":"2026-10-25T00:07:26.533Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-aea1a74d702396b3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8004 decomposition"}
